{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22188","headline":"寄张十八 · 白居易","name":"寄张十八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"饥止一箪食，渴止一壶浆。\n出入止一马，寝兴止一牀。\n此外无长物，於我有若亡。\n胡然不知足，名利心遑遑。\n念兹弥嬾放，积习遂爲常。\n经旬不出门，竟日不下堂。\n同病者张生，贫僻住延康。\n慵中每相忆，此意未能忘。\n迢迢青槐街，相去八九坊。\n秋来未相见，应有新诗章。\n早晚来同宿，天气转清凉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22188.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22188","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}